        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-710] If the EVCC receives a V2G response message with parameter EVSEProcessing equal to \"Ongoing\" for the first time in a response message it shall start the timer V2G_EVCC_Ongoing_Timer and wait for parameter EVSEProcessing equal to \"Finished\".",
