        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2101] If [V2G20-710] applies, the EVCC may stop the V2G communication session when V2G_EVCC_Ongoing_Timer is equal or larger than V2G_EVCC_Ongoing_Timeout and no parameter EVSE_Processing_equal to \"Finished\" has been received.",
