        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2102] If [V2G20-712] applies, the SECC may send ResponseCode equal to \"FAILED\" when V2G_SECC_Ongoing_Timer is equal or larger than V2G_SECC_Ongoing_Performance_Time and no parameter EVSEProcessing equal to \"Finished\" has been sent. The SECC shall stop the V2G communication session.",
